official_references.official_effect_text:
[b]When[/b] this card is Normal or Special Summoned: [b]You can[/b] activate 1 of these effects;
● [b]Destroy[/b] Spells/Traps on the field, up to the number of "HERO" monsters you control, except this card.
● Add 1 "HERO" monster from your Deck to your hand.
